@startuml SD_CoordinateRedistribution
title UC-F04 - Coordinate Vehicle Redistribution
hide footbox
autonumber
actor Operator
boundary "Redistribution UI" as UI
control "RedistributionController" as C
control "FeasibilityService (UC-S03)" as F
entity "VehicleRepository" as V
entity "HubRepository" as H
entity "AssignmentRepository" as A

Operator -> UI: Select vehicles, source Hub, destination Hub
Operator -> UI: Check feasibility
UI -> C: validateTransfer(selection, sourceId, destinationId)
C -> F: validate(selection, sourceId, destinationId)
loop Each selected vehicle
  F -> V: getCurrentStateAndCommitments(vehicleId)
  V --> F: Location, condition, rental/reservation, assignment
end
F -> H: getSourceAndDestinationCapacity()
H --> F: Hub status and available destination spaces
alt Data is stale or unavailable
  F --> C: Cannot safely validate
  C --> UI: Validation unavailable; refresh required
else Ineligible vehicles or insufficient capacity
  F --> C: Rejected vehicle IDs and reasons
  C --> UI: Show validation errors
  opt Operator changes selection or destination
    Operator -> UI: Revise request and retry
  end
else Feasible transfer
  F --> C: Validated proposal + state version
  C --> UI: Show feasible transfer summary
  Operator -> UI: Confirm assignment
  UI -> C: createAssignment(proposal, version)
  C -> F: Revalidate current state (UC-S03)
  alt Conflict arose before save
    F --> C: Conflict reason
    C --> UI: Reject stale proposal
  else Still feasible
    F --> C: Feasible
    C -> A: Save assignment and commitments atomically
    alt Save fails
      A --> C: Error; no assignment committed
      C --> UI: Show save error
    else Save succeeds
      A --> C: Assignment ID, Assigned state
      C --> UI: Assignment created
      UI --> Operator: Show assignment ID and status
    end
  end
end
note over C,A
Creating an assignment does not change vehicle location
or source/destination physical occupancy (UC-F04).
end note
@enduml
